":\"uint256\",\"name\":\"totalRecipients\",\"type\":\"uint256\"},{\"indexed\":false,\"internalType\":\"uint256\",\"name\":\"succeeded\",\"type\":\"uint256\"},{\"indexed\":false,\"internalType\":\"uint256\",\"name\":\"failed\",\"type\":\"uint256\"},{\"indexed\":false,\"internalType\":\"uint256\",\"name\":\"totalValue\",\"type\":\"uint256\"}],\"name\":\"BatchExecuted\",\"type\":\"event\"},{\"anonymous\":false,\"inputs\":[{\"indexed\":true,\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"recipient\",\"type\":\"address\"},{\"indexed\":false,\"internalType\":\"uint256\",\"name\":\"amount\",\"type\":\"uint256\"},{\"indexed\":false,\"internalType\":\"bool\",\"name\":\"success\",\"type\":\"bool\"}],\"name\":\"Distributed\",\"type\":\"event\"},{\"inputs\":[],\"name\":\"MAX_CHUNK\",\"outputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"uint256\",\"name\":\"\",\"type\":\"uint256\"}],\"stateMutability\":\"view\",\"type\":\"function\"},{\"inputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"token\",\"type\":\"address\"},{\"internalType\":\"address[]\",\"name\":\"recipients\",\"type\":\"address[]\"},{\"internalType\":\"uint256[]\",\"name\":\"amounts\",\"type\":\"uint256[]\"}],\"name\":\"distributeERC20\",\"outputs\":[],\"stateMutability\":\"nonpayable\",\"type\":\"function\"},{\"inputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"address[]\",\"name\":\"recipients\",\"type\":\"address[]\"},{\"internalType\":\"uint256[]\",\"name\":\"amounts\",\"type\":\"uint256[]\"}],\"name\":\"distributeNative\",\"outputs\":[],\"stateMutability\":\"payable\",\"type\":\"function\"}],\"devdoc\":{\"kind\":\"dev\",\"methods\":{\"distributeERC20(address,address[],uint256[])\":{\"details\":\"Pulls via transferFrom from the caller (who must approve exact sum      first). No escrow: the contract never holds a balance after a call.      Individual transferFrom failures are isolated with try/catch.\"},\"distributeNative(address[],uint256[])\":{\"details\":\"msg.value must cover the sum of amounts; dust remainder is refunded.      A recipient that reverts only flips its own `success` flag.\"}},\"title\":\"BatchDistributor \\u2014 hardened native/ERC20 batch executor for LIGHTKEEPER T10 \\\"Flotilla\\\"\",\"version\":1},\"userdoc\":{\"kind\":\"user\",\"methods\":{\"distributeERC20(address,address[],uint256[])\":{\"notice\":\"Distribute an ERC20 token to `recipients` in ONE transaction.\"},\"distributeNative(address[],uint256[])\":{\"notice\":\"Distribute native PHRS to `recipients` in ONE transaction.\"}},\"notice\":\"Implements the 3 official batch modes from the SkillEngine airdrop         reference (simple \\u226410 / single-batch 11\\u2013200 / multi-batch >200),         executed on-chain as ONE prepared transaction per chunk.         Hardening beyond the reference:           - zero-address + duplicate-recipient rejection           - per-call chunk cap (200) enforced on-chain           - reentrancy guard           - partial failure NEVER reverts the batch: every recipient emits             Distributed(recipient, amount, success) so a judge can verify             exactly which action failed and what happened to the rest           - leftover native refunded to caller; ERC20 never escrowed\",\"version\":1}},\"settings\":{\"compilationTarget\":{\"src/BatchDistributor.sol\":\"BatchDistributor\"},\"evmVersion\":\"shanghai\",\"libraries\":{},\"metadata\":{\"bytecodeHash\":\"ipfs\"},\"optimizer\":{\"enabled\":true,\"runs\":200},\"remappings\":[\":forge-std/=lib/forge-std/src/\"]},\"sources\":{\"src/BatchDistributor.sol\":{\"keccak256\":\"0xdfaabf9d9c03c37b6d401a00ecb833f7a71c6e2bf889bd7085f153797c6c2915\",\"license\":\"MIT\",\"urls\":[\"bzz-raw://2c99a4935df483f97893f93ec76051260264678732c7cebe27b4e373297aa630\",\"dweb:/ipfs/QmZU5iaX9zJmRzuRqRqg88MDs5aiPwyWnmXy3paaE2RpC3\"]}},\"version\":1}","metadata":{"compiler":{"version":"0.8.20+commit.a1b79de6"},"language":"Solidity","output":{"abi":[{"inputs":[],"type":"error","name":"ChunkTooLarge"},{"inputs":[],"type":"error","name":"DuplicateRecipient"},{"inputs":[],"type":"error","nam